meta {
  name: Get All CAT Tokens
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: https://api.spacescan.io/tokens
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}

docs {
  # Get All CAT Tokens
  
  Fetches a list of all registered CAT tokens on the Chia blockchain.
  This endpoint returns basic information about each token including
  their asset IDs and icon URLs.
  
  ## Response Fields
  
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | status | string | "success" or "error" |
  | cats | array | Array of CAT token objects |
  
  ### CAT Token Object
  
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | asset_id | string | The token's unique asset ID (64-character hex) |
  | token_id | string | Bech32m encoded token ID (tkn...) |
  | name | string | Full name of the token |
  | symbol | string | Token ticker symbol |
  | description | string | Token description |
  | preview_url | string\|null | URL to the token's icon/logo |
  | tags | string | Comma-separated tags |
  | twitter | string\|null | Twitter URL |
  | discord | string\|null | Discord invite URL |
  | website | string\|null | Official website URL |
  
  ## Example Response (truncated)
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "cats": [
      {
        "asset_id": "14b40962dfef81d954ac0d92b51ec21ce7acd8c62dd9fef9303aa51c615cb495",
        "token_id": "tkn1zj6qjckla7qaj49vpkft28kzrnn6ekxx9hvla7fs82j3cc2ukj2ssa84km",
        "name": "LLC Burn Token",
        "description": "...",
        "symbol": "LLBT",
        "preview_url": "https://assets.spacescan.io/cat/f5cd9dccc98c1fd4f32b599324b6dd938c793c0e50af7581195aee603277bad8.webp",
        "tags": "meme",
        "twitter": "https://twitter.com/LittleLamboCoin",
        "discord": "https://discord.gg/Ew96DzCxc7",
        "website": "https://littlelambocoin.com/llc-burn-token"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ## Usage in Pengui
  
  This endpoint can be used to batch-fetch all token metadata and icons.
  However, for performance reasons, Pengui currently fetches token info
  on-demand using the individual token info endpoint and caches results
  in IndexedDB.
}
